{"seq":1,"slug":"customer-risk-rating-cdd-edd","title":"客户风险分级与 CDD/EDD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/customer-risk-tuning/customer-risk-rating-cdd-edd","wordCount":2360,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"客户风险分级与-cdd-edd\">客户风险分级与 CDD/EDD</h1><p>反洗钱体系从&quot;规则为本&quot;转向&quot;风险为本&quot;之后，客户风险分级从一项辅助工作变成了整个体系的中枢。它决定了一个客户被监控的强度、尽职调查的深度、以及每一笔交易被赋予的阈值。分级错了，后面所有环节都会偏离——把高风险客户评为低风险，等于给他开了免检通道；把低风险客户评为高风险，则制造大量无意义的人工负担。</p>\n<p>风险分级的工程难点不在于算出一个分数，而在于<strong>这个分数必须可解释、可复现、可申诉</strong>。客户有权知道为什么被列为高风险并申请复核；监管有权知道每一档客户是怎么被划进去的。这排除了&quot;用机器学习模型直接给个分&quot;的做法——至少在监管可接受的形式上，分级必须由显式规则驱动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>客户风险由三类因子构成：<strong>固有风险</strong>（客户本身的属性决定的、无法通过后天控制改变的风险）、<strong>控制有效性</strong>（机构对该客户实施的控制措施是否充分）、以及<strong>行为风险</strong>（客户实际交易行为显示出的风险）。最终的风险档是固有风险经控制有效性调整后，再叠加行为风险的结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[客户属性&lt;br/&gt;地域/业务/渠道/结构] --&gt; D[固有风险分]&#10;  B[控制措施&lt;br/&gt;身份核验/受益所有人/持续监控] --&gt; E[控制有效性分]&#10;  D --&gt; F[残余风险 = 固有 × 控制调整]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  G[交易行为&lt;br/&gt;实际交易画像] --&gt; H[行为风险分]&#10;  F --&gt; I[综合风险档]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[差异化策略&lt;br/&gt;CDD深度/阈值/监控频率]&#10;  J --&gt; K[定期复核&lt;br/&gt;触发式重评]&#10;  K --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[客户属性&lt;br/&gt;地域/业务/渠道/结构] --&gt; D[固有风险分]\n  B[控制措施&lt;br/&gt;身份核验/受益所有人/持续监控] --&gt; E[控制有效性分]\n  D --&gt; F[残余风险 = 固有 × 控制调整]\n  E --&gt; F\n  G[交易行为&lt;br/&gt;实际交易画像] --&gt; H[行为风险分]\n  F --&gt; I[综合风险档]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[差异化策略&lt;br/&gt;CDD深度/阈值/监控频率]\n  J --&gt; K[定期复核&lt;br/&gt;触发式重评]\n  K --&gt; G</pre><p><code>残余风险 = 固有 × 控制调整</code> 这个乘法关系是风险为本的精髓：一个位于高风险辖区的客户，如果机构对他实施了完整的受益所有人穿透与强化监控，其残余风险可以降下来，不必永远被当作最高风险对待。反之，一个形式上低风险的客户，如果身份信息无法核实，控制有效性差，残余风险反而上升。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险因子的量化\">风险因子的量化</h2><h3 id=\"固有风险因子\">固有风险因子</h3><p>固有风险因子按维度组织，每个维度下若干因子，因子赋分后加权。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>因子示例</th>\n<th>权重方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地域</td>\n<td>注册地/居住地/主要交易对手所在辖区</td>\n<td>高风险辖区加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务性质</td>\n<td>行业、职业、经营模式</td>\n<td>现金密集行业加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道</td>\n<td>开户渠道、主要交易渠道</td>\n<td>非面对面开户加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有权结构</td>\n<td>是否为复杂股权、离岸结构、名义股东</td>\n<td>复杂度加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户类型</td>\n<td>自然人/法人/信托/代理</td>\n<td>代理与信托加分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品</td>\n<td>是否使用高风险产品（跨境、匿名性产品）</td>\n<td>加分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>赋分需要<strong>权重与档位</strong>，而不是简单累加。累加会让因子数量主导结果——加了十个低权因子等于一个高权因子。实用做法是每个维度内部先归一化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再按维度权重合成。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{inherent} = \\sum_{d \\in D} w_d \\cdot \\mathrm{norm}\\Big(\\sum_{f \\in d} s_f \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">inh</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">norm</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是维度权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>d</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_d w_d = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是维度内因子的原始分。归一化函数 <code>norm</code> 是分段的（例如 0–30 低、31–60 中、61–100 高），因为监管期望的是<strong>档位</strong>而非连续分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"控制有效性\">控制有效性</h3><p>控制有效性衡量机构对该客户实施的控制是否到位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>身份信息是否经过独立核验（而非仅客户自述）</li>\n<li>受益所有人是否已识别且经过核验</li>\n<li>是否理解客户的资金来源与财富来源</li>\n<li>是否建立了持续监控</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每一项有明确的完成状态，未完成项按<strong>风险提升因子</strong>处理。例如&quot;受益所有人未识别&quot;在高风险客户上应将残余风险提升一个档位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"行为风险\">行为风险</h3><p>行为风险来自实际交易，它的特殊之处是<strong>动态</strong>——它随交易持续更新，因此需要周期性（通常按日或按周）重算，并在跨越档位边界时触发重评。行为因子包括：交易规模与申报业务的偏离度、跨境交易占比、现金交易占比、对手方分散度、名单命中历史。其中前几项直接复用 <a href=\"../realtime-screening-engine/aggregation-window-counterparty\">聚合窗口与对手方网络</a> 中已经计算的特征，不应重新实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级驱动的差异化策略\">分级驱动的差异化策略</h2><p>风险档不是标签，它必须映射到具体的系统行为。映射关系应当是<strong>声明式配置</strong>，而不是散落在代码里的条件判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险档</th>\n<th>CDD 深度</th>\n<th>监控阈值</th>\n<th>复核周期</th>\n<th>审批要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>标准身份核验</td>\n<td>默认阈值</td>\n<td>多年</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>标准 + 资金来源说明</td>\n<td>默认阈值</td>\n<td>定期</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>强化（受益所有人穿透、财富来源）</td>\n<td>收紧阈值</td>\n<td>较短</td>\n<td>主管审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>强化 + 高层审批 + 可能拒绝</td>\n<td>最严阈值</td>\n<td>最短</td>\n<td>高管审批</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 风险档 → 系统行为的声明式映射&#10;tiers:&#10;  high:&#10;    cdd:&#10;      beneficial_owner_required: true&#10;      source_of_funds_documentation: true&#10;      source_of_wealth_documentation: true&#10;      senior_management_approval: false&#10;    monitoring:&#10;      param_profile: &#39;profile_high&#39; # 引向参数覆盖层&#10;      review_interval_days: 180&#10;      enhanced_scrutiny_new_channels: true&#10;    refresh:&#10;      trigger_on: [&#39;ownership_change&#39;, &#39;peer_risk_up&#39;, &#39;alert_confirmed&#39;]&#10;  very_high:&#10;    cdd:&#10;      senior_management_approval: true&#10;      consider_declination: true&#10;    monitoring:&#10;      param_profile: &#39;profile_very_high&#39;&#10;      review_interval_days: 90\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 风险档 → 系统行为的声明式映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">tiers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  high</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cdd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      beneficial_owner_required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      source_of_funds_documentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      source_of_wealth_documentation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      senior_management_approval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    monitoring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      param_profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'profile_high'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 引向参数覆盖层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      review_interval_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      enhanced_scrutiny_new_channels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    refresh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      trigger_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ownership_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'peer_risk_up'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alert_confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  very_high</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cdd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      senior_management_approval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      consider_declination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    monitoring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      param_profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'profile_very_high'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      review_interval_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>monitoring.param_profile</code> 直接引用 <a href=\"../aml-scenario-rule/aml-rule-library\">监控规则库与阈值配置</a> 中的参数覆盖层名。这个引用是整个体系咬合的关键点：风险分级不直接写阈值，而是选择一个参数剖面，阈值本身仍然由规则库集中管理。这样调阈值只需要改一处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定期复核与触发式重评\">定期复核与触发式重评</h2><h3 id=\"周期复核\">周期复核</h3><p>每个风险档有对应的复核周期。周期复核不是简单地重新计算分数，而是一次完整的 CDD 更新：核实客户信息是否变化、受益所有人是否变化、业务性质是否变化。复核超期本身是检查中的观察项，因此系统必须跟踪 <code>next_review_due</code> 并对超期客户产生处置动作（通常是在超期一段时间后将风险档强制上调，直到完成复核）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发式重评\">触发式重评</h3><p>除了周期，下列事件应立即触发重评：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有权或控制权变更（股东变更、受益所有人变更）</li>\n<li>名单命中（含灰区潜在匹配的确认）</li>\n<li>案件被确认为可疑并报送</li>\n<li>交易画像发生显著偏移（行为风险跨档）</li>\n<li>监管或同业发布新的高风险辖区/行业指引</li>\n</ul>\n<p>触发式重评的价值在于它把风险分级从静态档案变成了活的系统。工程上要防止的是<strong>触发风暴</strong>：一次名单更新可能命中大量客户，如果每一条都立即触发完整重评会压垮流程。做法是批量触发加优先级排序，且名单类触发只做轻量检查（重新比对名单），不做完整 CDD 复核。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 触发式重评队列：同一客户的多重触发合并为一条最高优先级任务&#10;INSERT INTO cdd_review_task (entity_id, trigger_kind, priority, due_at)&#10;SELECT entity_id,&#10;       MAX(trigger_kind) AS trigger_kind,&#10;       MAX(priority)     AS priority,&#10;       MIN(due_at)       AS due_at&#10;FROM (&#10;  SELECT entity_id, &#39;ownership_change&#39; AS trigger_kind, 8 AS priority,&#10;         now() + INTERVAL &#39;5 days&#39; AS due_at&#10;  FROM ownership_change_event WHERE processed = false&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT entity_id, &#39;list_hit_confirmed&#39;, 10, now() + INTERVAL &#39;1 day&#39;&#10;  FROM list_match_pending WHERE confirmed = true&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT entity_id, &#39;behavior_shift&#39;, 5, now() + INTERVAL &#39;15 days&#39;&#10;  FROM entity_behavior_tier_change WHERE detected_at &gt; now() - INTERVAL &#39;1 day&#39;&#10;) t&#10;GROUP BY entity_id&#10;ON CONFLICT (entity_id) DO UPDATE&#10;  SET priority = GREATEST(cdd_review_task.priority, EXCLUDED.priority),&#10;      due_at   = LEAST(cdd_review_task.due_at, EXCLUDED.due_at),&#10;      trigger_kind = EXCLUDED.trigger_kind;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 触发式重评队列：同一客户的多重触发合并为一条最高优先级任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cdd_review_task (entity_id, trigger_kind, priority, due_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trigger_kind) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger_kind,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(priority)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(due_at)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> due_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ownership_change'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger_kind, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5 days'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> due_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ownership_change_event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'list_hit_confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list_match_pending </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> confirmed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'behavior_shift'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'15 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_behavior_tier_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detected_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 day'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (entity_id) DO </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cdd_review_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      due_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LEAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cdd_review_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">due_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">due_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      trigger_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">trigger_kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ON CONFLICT ... GREATEST/LEAST</code> 实现了合并语义：同一客户已有待办任务时，取最高优先级与最早期限，避免同一客户堆积多条任务。<code>MIN(due_at)</code> 保证最紧急的触发决定截止日。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险分级的治理问题\">风险分级的治理问题</h2><h3 id=\"不可用分数掩盖判断\">不可用分数掩盖判断</h3><p>分级系统最常见的退化是：运营团队只看分数不看构成。一旦如此，分数里的错误会长期不被发现。对抗手段是<strong>强制展示构成</strong>——任何查看风险档的界面都必须同时展示贡献最大的前三个因子及其原始值。这不只是 UI 要求，它决定了数据模型必须保存因子级别的明细而不是只存总分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分布监控\">分布监控</h3><p>风险档的分布应当被持续监控。如果某一段时间高风险客户占比突然从 3% 升到 15%，要么是业务结构真实变化，要么是某个因子被错误配置。没有分布监控，这类配置错误可能持续数月，期间产生的大量警报会挤占调查资源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控项</th>\n<th>异常信号</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>各档占比</td>\n<td>单档突变 &gt; 50%</td>\n<td>因子配置错误或业务突变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复核超期率</td>\n<td>持续上升</td>\n<td>人力不足或流程阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重评触发量</td>\n<td>单日暴增</td>\n<td>名单更新或上游数据异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>档位迁移率</td>\n<td>异常高</td>\n<td>因子权重不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"申诉与更正\">申诉与更正</h3><p>客户有权对风险档提出异议。工程上需要支持：记录申诉、暂停相关的不利处置（在合规允许范围内）、记录申诉结论与依据。申诉数据是分级质量的重要反馈源——大量申诉集中在同一个因子上，说明该因子的定义或数据源有问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>风险为本要求分级可解释、可复现、可申诉，因此分级必须由显式规则驱动而非黑盒模型。</li>\n<li>残余风险 = 固有风险经控制有效性调整，乘法关系体现了控制措施可以降低高风险客户的残余风险。</li>\n<li>固有风险因子按维度归一化后加权合成，输出档位而非连续分；行为风险应复用已有窗口与图特征，不重复实现。</li>\n<li>风险档通过 <code>param_profile</code> 间接引用规则库的参数覆盖层，阈值仍集中管理。</li>\n<li>复核既要周期触发也要事件触发，触发需合并去重以防风暴；周期复核超期应强制上调风险档。</li>\n<li>必须保存因子级明细以强制展示构成，并持续监控档位分布以发现配置错误。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关：分级产出的阈值剖面见 <a href=\"../aml-scenario-rule/aml-rule-library\">监控规则库与阈值配置</a>；名单命中触发的重评见 <a href=\"../realtime-screening-engine/watchlist-hit-correlation\">名单命中关联联动</a>；分级如何被检查验证见 <a href=\"../customer-risk-tuning/regulator-exam-records\">监管检查与留档</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"客户风险分级与 CDD/EDD","id":"客户风险分级与-cdd-edd"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"风险因子的量化","id":"风险因子的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"固有风险因子","id":"固有风险因子"},{"level":3,"text":"控制有效性","id":"控制有效性"},{"level":3,"text":"行为风险","id":"行为风险"},{"level":2,"text":"分级驱动的差异化策略","id":"分级驱动的差异化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"定期复核与触发式重评","id":"定期复核与触发式重评"},{"level":3,"text":"周期复核","id":"周期复核"},{"level":3,"text":"触发式重评","id":"触发式重评"},{"level":2,"text":"风险分级的治理问题","id":"风险分级的治理问题"},{"level":3,"text":"不可用分数掩盖判断","id":"不可用分数掩盖判断"},{"level":3,"text":"分布监控","id":"分布监控"},{"level":3,"text":"申诉与更正","id":"申诉与更正"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可疑报告叙事与证据链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/alert-investigation-report/sar-narrative-evidence"},"next":{"title":"规则调优与误报治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/customer-risk-tuning/alert-tuning-false-positive"}}